Package: biosyntax
Type: Package
Title: Syntax Highlighting for Biological Data in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("kojix2", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "kojix2@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Highlights biological text such as FASTA, FASTQ, SAM, VCF, BED,
    GTF, GFF and PDB. The package embeds the dependency-free 'libbiosyntax' C
    engine and produces ANSI, HTML and token-span output. It also accepts
    objects from 'Biostrings', 'VariantAnnotation' and 'GenomicRanges'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: See file inst/COPYRIGHTS.
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Suggests:
    BiocStyle,
    Biostrings,
    GenomicRanges,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    rtracklayer,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    VariantAnnotation
VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: C99
URL: https://github.com/kojix2/biosyntax
BugReports: https://github.com/kojix2/biosyntax/issues
biocViews: DataRepresentation, Visualization, Sequencing, VariantAnnotation
Config/testthat/edition: 3
